{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "1_2_025_02_e",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:d50f12259053668caf0983a690ee9af86c33769c73ef188920a2e9c8855f0419",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:1_2_025suz_02_1_2_025_02:1_2_025_02_e:cmd-000016:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0caba00123987c65267cb553eff1c391af5c1350a25058166325804f0b0c7b21",
      "text": "生日当天……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_025suz_02_1_2_025_02:1_2_025_02_e:cmd-000035:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ef9903256934d769cf47ed1aa8bc4f437170ba12d10ffb9e3879938a659998e5",
      "text": "辛苦啦，制作人！\n所以，今天的碰头会是关于什么的？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_025suz_02_1_2_025_02:1_2_025_02_e:cmd-000037:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2f04bce7348c636b61650ff355963b2d26328b4900ce41865b34780cef3b086d",
      "text": "现在还在准备中。\n请稍等片刻。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_025suz_02_1_2_025_02:1_2_025_02_e:cmd-000051:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3cd1d1bc31d0db99dc3f2ec8cae88d180c3e31fcafe1386bb25908d261b60c5f",
      "text": "让你久等了，朱雀。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_025suz_02_1_2_025_02:1_2_025_02_e:cmd-000057:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b0c9e8b30e79987b83828222db8ea184487915f252696b18317d7db56b38570d",
      "text": "玄武？嗯？你手里拿的那个是……！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_025suz_02_1_2_025_02:1_2_025_02_e:cmd-000062:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5b73d4af6e2e87b471d1c8756ba6309f4547bcacb58fafb7d72593d0b06998b0",
      "text": "生日快乐，搭档。\n我为你烤了松饼。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_025suz_02_1_2_025_02:1_2_025_02_e:cmd-000070:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e48fb661c5e43258b94ca8227bf0f093750dfe81fc8ad25af5bec353207061c8",
      "text": "为、为我……？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_025suz_02_1_2_025_02:1_2_025_02_e:cmd-000076:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e19fa0cbcb16f9ea777730b360af2b6bddfd7f405f8ffad9b3ba27139fc6522e",
      "text": "这样啊，今天是……这么说来，\n碰头会其实是为了给我庆祝！？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_025suz_02_1_2_025_02:1_2_025_02_e:cmd-000079:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:185777f8fa012d68149cb975a3ee2e93ebe2060719987cd5932b7131016e4302",
      "text": "是的。\n我帮忙筹划了这个惊喜。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_025suz_02_1_2_025_02:1_2_025_02_e:cmd-000083:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d89e829c87c28c16752aa2c4a441c6a5e03a176f2dc39ae8565aae1d8065c13b",
      "text": "那难不成，\n最近闻到的甜甜味道也是……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_025suz_02_1_2_025_02:1_2_025_02_e:cmd-000086:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:29503552a06617e496be12cb44ddbf83719dd624de9e6f26ac08ec179c3d33a3",
      "text": "制作人说的\n你迷上做点心也是……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_025suz_02_1_2_025_02:1_2_025_02_e:cmd-000092:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6f0538b9ecc2593f5da994d4ac1c3eb0ef4fd9b7a774d9dafbfc12bf16bcdf85",
      "text": "抱歉啊，唯独这件事我想保密。\n所以借了番长一点力量。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_025suz_02_1_2_025_02:1_2_025_02_e:cmd-000098:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1e924f5492c98b06941a083a32343084619321ee318bf46d24b262696fa9fae8",
      "text": "趁热吃吧。\n这可是到现在为止做得最棒的一块了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_025suz_02_1_2_025_02:1_2_025_02_e:cmd-000105:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d975667641ef6d975039a5b41d3bf2666edd6c7fa1344d163b83ab6f684fe86a",
      "text": "我太高兴了玄武！\n那我就不客气地……开动啦！！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_025suz_02_1_2_025_02:1_2_025_02_e:cmd-000118:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:59d295441e05ae8719baa9a0cfdb06b9ec656be584ea24ac1ab25408836cec35",
      "text": "……好吃！我还是第一次吃到这么好吃的松饼！\n可恶，眼眶都要湿了……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_025suz_02_1_2_025_02:1_2_025_02_e:cmd-000123:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:51a93df6fcb295fde7fcc93a26837ddacd71438c6d8ffa96805c7e8bb2a5d714",
      "text": "能让你这么高兴真是太好了。多亏了英雄大哥\n教我的特制配方啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_025suz_02_1_2_025_02:1_2_025_02_e:cmd-000130:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2a39613e4a08af7a941c1609a24938a68ab8489ef1d7bf6aaba44bbf9958068f",
      "text": "虽说也有那个原因啦。但我觉得，\n果然还是因为包含着玄武炽热的心意啊！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_025suz_02_1_2_025_02:1_2_025_02_e:cmd-000136:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:39e86bda2e6f80c8c2e9ae9b6893164d3540a00aec38d4d6a107d38c47b18942",
      "text": "真的太感谢了，玄武！\n你果然是我最棒的搭档！",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
